  "body": "The explanatory text of the assertion in [HostResolveImportedModule](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hostresolveimportedmodule(referencingscriptormodule,-specifier)) stating that [resolve a module specifier ](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resolve-a-module-specifier) must have been previously successful lists [HostImportModuleDynamically](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hostimportmoduledynamically(referencingscriptormodule,-specifier,-promisecapability)) as one of the places where [resolve a module specifier](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resolve-a-module-specifier) would previously have succeeded.  However, it's [fetch() an import() module script graph](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-an-import()-module-script-graph), called by [HostImportModuleDynamically](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#hostimportmoduledynamically(referencingscriptormodule,-specifier,-promisecapability)), where [resolve a module specifier](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resolve-a-module-specifier) is actually called.  Update the assertion text to reference [fetch() an import() module script graph](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#fetch-an-import()-module-script-graph) directly.\n\nThe corresponding assertion in [find the first parse error](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#finding-the-first-parse-error) didn't have a link to where the prior [resolve a module specifier](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#resolve-a-module-specifier) call would occur, so add one.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6031/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 5, 2020, 6:49 PM UTC (21a199d)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/6031/0337d29...21a199d/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Oct 5, 2020, 6:49 PM UTC (21a199d)\">diff</a> )",
